      "comment" : "PENDING HUMAN APPROVAL (D-11): revised for the owner's opt-in privacy posture (2026-10-20): local first, nothing leaves the Mac unless the person switches it on, and the remote judge may see everything the app knows. The local-first privacy statement shown in the Privacy settings tab.",
